  "name": "visualizers",
  "description": "A suite of WebAssembly-based visualization components for the Hades protocol analysis framework. It provides interactive, canvas-backed rendering for block Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs), protocol execution sequences, and finite state machine transitions. The library leverages the Yew framework and web-sys to map complex protocol primitives, such as Morpheus blocks and view-based consensus data, into navigable graphical representations.",
